{'symbol': 'PLD', 'date': '2019-12-05 22:30:00', 'title': 'PROLOGIS, INC. DECLARES REGULAR COMMON AND PREFERRED STOCK DIVIDEND FOR THE QUARTER ENDING DECEMBER 31, 2019, PAYABLE ON DECEMBER 31, 2019', 'text': "THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF PROLOGIS, INC. DECLARED A REGULAR CASH DIVIDEND FOR THE QUARTER ENDING DECEMBER 31, 2019, ON THE FOLLOWING SECURITIES: A DIVIDEND OF $0.53 PER SHARE OF THE COMPANY'S COMMON STOCK, PAYABLE ON DECEMBER 31, 2019, TO COMMON STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON DECEMBER 19, 2019; AND A DIVIDEND OF $1.0675 PER SHARE OF THE COMPANY'S 8.54% SERIES Q CUMULATIVE REDEEMABLE PREFERRED STOCK, PAYABLE ON DECEMBER 31, 2019, TO SERIES Q STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON DECEMBER 19, 2019."}